    "sha256": "5868a7b5626a925650278b005aef09e2b98bda1e468db111013102a54b025a01",
    "text": "The first Sorrowful Mystery. The Agony in the Garden. The fruit of this mystery is faithfulness to the Father's will.",
    "text_sha256": "efd8f255e2ac122af705efb7acb3485c7871e1dec8edb28b1560ad6248f8df17"
  },
  {
