    "sha256": "c71fde49bde914073262f70ca6f1f39b115883422ca335e15194a74b00146dc7",
    "text": "The second Sorrowful Mystery. The Scourging at the Pillar. The fruit of this mystery is purity of heart.",
    "text_sha256": "4664f64d648db556859faeb99511e20aa0ff4b2433ba02ced73542dff069c8a8"
  },
  {
