    "kind": "meditation",
    "section": 3,
    "start": 905.840000000001,
    "duration": 31.16,
    "bead": 0,
    "file": "/downloads/daily-rosary-tuesday/achird-wavs/sorrowful_3-step-01.wav",
    "sha256": "c8453c17e6a9d4faed28aa31464c44f192f1324b4b3e3e3d44ed5dbf342dfcc5",
    "text": "Pilate offers release, but the crowd chooses Barabbas. Soldiers clothe Jesus in purple, press thorns on His head, strike and mock Him, and lead Him to crucifixion. The true King accepts humiliation without hatred.\n\nThe Crowning with Thorns reveals mocked kingship: Christ reigns through truth, humility, and love.\n\nStay with this mystery as you pray.",
    "text_sha256": "30a93a49c6fa705ffc184e62a8b2b4bc32b7bbd59d6a81a551f41ff127afb3d6"
  },
  {
