    "sha256": "d8d991727c34abd70da874d78642ee877184d495492c066458fd54a2ee337dd5",
    "text": "The fourth Sorrowful Mystery. The Carrying of the Cross. The fruit of this mystery is patience and faithful endurance.",
    "text_sha256": "58a2cb6620a64c5c493bed199e9ef083d3f83fb6eb1a534fc5f5b330b2141bcf"
  },
  {
    "key": "sorrowful_4-step-01",
    "kind": "meditation",
    "section": 4,
    "start": 1271.6200000000015,
    "duration": 30.52,
    "bead": 0,
    "file": "/downloads/daily-rosary-tuesday/achird-wavs/sorrowful_4-step-01.wav",
    "sha256": "30ce1db784acc832dc963bc375d33410d123bc9580756c4477d362c155974bf2",
    "text": "Pilate yields to pressure and delivers Jesus to be crucified. Jesus carries the Cross; Simon of Cyrene is compelled to help. Women mourn as Jesus speaks to them with prophetic compassion. The road of suffering becomes the road of redemption.\n\nOn the way to Calvary, Christ carries the Cross and invites discipleship through endurance.\n\nStay with this mystery as you pray.",
    "text_sha256": "d5eb70ff1c092f9e3918ad43b6ccaf6c97a9191f93b64e3cd0499e878121cc28"
  },
  {
    "key": "sorrowful_4-step-03",
