    "sha256": "5f66fe7f45772a9d1e0b8194b0aa61a98dea9861c558560980b3ebd1c1f55e64",
    "text": "The fifth Sorrowful Mystery. The Crucifixion. The fruit of this mystery is self-giving love and repentance.",
    "text_sha256": "ad681cf31d684934e9c0535af058c94a02ed1e9a88a61950288026aac89a0b3b"
