    "duration": 30.72,
    "bead": 0,
    "file": "/downloads/daily-rosary-tuesday/achird-wavs/sorrowful_5-step-01.wav",
    "sha256": "e5767ff94c56c5ff36f703dbe137dc3200579424e2d208390b12aa76b95633bf",
    "text": "Jesus is crucified between two criminals. He is mocked, yet forgives and promises paradise to the repentant thief. Darkness falls; then Jesus cries out, \"Father, into thy hands I commend my spirit.\" Then He dies. The centurion recognizes His innocence.\n\nAt Calvary, Jesus offers His life completely and opens mercy even at the hour of death.\n\nStay with this mystery as you pray.",
    "text_sha256": "ab845e253bff00cc834449fe4f5a1c7bbf997ab07a34cc0dfee63c40d4f4c8e4"
  },
  {
